    "body": "- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n\r\nResolve #1901\r\n\r\nThis includes a small shim (in each of the affected modules) that uses the new signature on Neovim >= 0.11. Let me know if a different approach would be preferred.",
    "closed_at": "2025-12-29T15:47:10Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/pull/2199#discussion_r2650130157"
