            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "In general, I'd indeed ask to use as consistent compatibility helpers across modules as possible. This will make it much easier to cleanup after dropping support of Neovim version.\r\n\r\nHere though I think it is cleaner to create the helper. The only usage is indeed under `Neovim<0.10` condition, so it will be removed after compatibility with Neovim=0.9 is dropped. But if there is a helper under `Neovim<0.11`, it might (if not careful) stick around until compatibility with Neovim=0.10 is dropped. Which is a long time.",
            "commit_id": "58596b8cbe92710a47f84ed08b0642bce3d73bc9",
            "copilot_code_review_sources": [],
            "created_at": "2025-12-29T10:11:51Z",
