            "body": "Similar to `H.str_utfindex`:\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\nH.str_byteindex = function(s, i) return vim.str_byteindex(s, 'utf-32', i) end\r\nif vim.fn.has('nvim-0.11') == 0 then H.str_byteindex = function(s, i) return vim.str_byteindex(s, i) end end\r\n```",
